{"path":"/2021/03/veganiskas-bulviu-plokstainis.html","kind":"article","title":"Veganiškas bulvių plokštainis (#PenktadienioReceptai)","description":"Kaina : nedidelė Laikas : ~2 val. Jums reikės: 10 bulvių 1 nedidelė cukinija 2 svogūnai 1 stiklinė avižų pieno 2 šaukštai alyvuogių aliejau...","published":"2021-03-29T11:38:00+03:00","section":"Tikėjimas ir kultūra","labels":["PenktadienioReceptai","receptai"],"hero":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411094437im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-qoRMGs32Zxk/YF-MtlFlFkI/AAAAAAABIfk/CNMWJO98BvAPRV_Sh9kbM4qBJlXA_I7RQCPcBGAsYHg/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/IMG_20210327_032831.jpg","html":"<div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-qoRMGs32Zxk/YF-MtlFlFkI/AAAAAAABIfk/CNMWJO98BvAPRV_Sh9kbM4qBJlXA_I7RQCPcBGAsYHg/s3264/IMG_20210327_032831.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411094437im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-qoRMGs32Zxk/YF-MtlFlFkI/AAAAAAABIfk/CNMWJO98BvAPRV_Sh9kbM4qBJlXA_I7RQCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_032831.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><b>Kaina</b>: nedidelė<div><b>Laikas</b>: ~2 val.</div><div><br><b>Jums reikės:</b><br><div> 10 bulvių<div>1 nedidelė cukinija<br>2 svogūnai<br>1 stiklinė avižų pieno<br>2 šaukštai alyvuogių aliejaus<br>Druska ir pipirai<br><br><i>Užpilui:</i></div><div>Svogūnai, pievagrybiai, druska (pagal skonį)<br><br><b>Paruošimas:</b></div><div><br><br>1. Nuskutame bulves, nuvalome svogūnus, stambiai supjaustome cukiniją (ir pašaliname sėklas, jei yra).</div><div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/--8FHo_KgPqc/YF-MtrQufCI/AAAAAAABIfk/AWFG4QvL5DwFRUBXiut4rP1jTZ1mcmlDwCPcBGAsYHg/s4160/IMG_20210327_013635%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411094437im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/--8FHo_KgPqc/YF-MtrQufCI/AAAAAAABIfk/AWFG4QvL5DwFRUBXiut4rP1jTZ1mcmlDwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_013635%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>2. Nuvalome svogūnus, pusantro svogūno supjaustome smulkiai ir apkepame, pusę svogūno pasiliekame tarkavimui.</div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Ksn6ckXi6n0/YF-MtutaM9I/AAAAAAABIfk/xP5P5qLwG_MznAyiZ8pilpNXqtDk2SeSQCPcBGAsYHg/s2926/IMG_20210327_013640%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411094437im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Ksn6ckXi6n0/YF-MtutaM9I/AAAAAAABIfk/xP5P5qLwG_MznAyiZ8pilpNXqtDk2SeSQCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_013640%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>2. Sutarkuojame bulves, pusę svogūno, cukiniją. Aš tai darau virtuviniu kombainu.</div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9WfI2e1ujdg/YF-MtmrnylI/AAAAAAABIfk/rVmaR4_YjJkZ4QNldYrgzOwAvpZCjj2IQCPcBGAsYHg/s4160/IMG_20210327_013647%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411094437im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9WfI2e1ujdg/YF-MtmrnylI/AAAAAAABIfk/rVmaR4_YjJkZ4QNldYrgzOwAvpZCjj2IQCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_013647%257E2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>3. Sutarkuotą masę ir apkepintus svogūnus pilame į kepimo formą (arba aliejumi suteptą skardą). Jei ji nesusimaišiusi, pamaišome.</div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-TXlHKws6NWs/YF-MthxBkYI/AAAAAAABIfk/lyUSYTSfmWknlzAWPGaOSFF5-T70J8VigCPcBGAsYHg/s4160/IMG_20210327_015242%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411094437im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-TXlHKws6NWs/YF-MthxBkYI/AAAAAAABIfk/lyUSYTSfmWknlzAWPGaOSFF5-T70J8VigCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_015242%257E2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>4. Užviriname avižų pieną ir juo nuplikome masę. Aš virinau pieną nedideliame, metaliniame puode pamaišydamas.</div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-2sOEas1_ojI/YF-MtngZaoI/AAAAAAABIfk/8FmqjCmVzC0PTQRfFkWmU8Jv1q7NZfMRgCPcBGAsYHg/s4160/IMG_20210327_015527%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411094437im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-2sOEas1_ojI/YF-MtngZaoI/AAAAAAABIfk/8FmqjCmVzC0PTQRfFkWmU8Jv1q7NZfMRgCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_015527%257E2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>5. Pašauname į įkaitintą orkaitę, 1 valandą - 200 laipsnių temp., po to 30 min. - 160 laipsnių.</div><div><br></div><div>6. Bulvių plokštainis (kugelis) baigtas.</div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-IsC_8o3-PT8/YF-MttVD_3I/AAAAAAABIfk/xVpRcJWkUfcpMq-DRAxteHPPivKISj-ggCPcBGAsYHg/s4160/IMG_20210327_032701%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411094437im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-IsC_8o3-PT8/YF-MttVD_3I/AAAAAAABIfk/xVpRcJWkUfcpMq-DRAxteHPPivKISj-ggCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_032701%257E2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Vmfza9Bo9ZE/YF-Mtm4XeQI/AAAAAAABIfk/LJqqJrODuEo7rT5kL8CmKI6VCLxmp8sIgCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_032840.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411094437im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Vmfza9Bo9ZE/YF-Mtm4XeQI/AAAAAAABIfk/LJqqJrODuEo7rT5kL8CmKI6VCLxmp8sIgCPcBGAsYHg/s0/IMG_20210327_032840.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div>7. Galima pasiskaninti veganiška grietine, keptais svogūnais ir/arba pievagrybiais. Pievagrybius&nbsp;supjaustome su svogūnais, apkepiname, užpilame ant plokštainio.<br><br><i>Receptas paimtas iš Instagram profilio @viskasbe, gaminimo aprašymas ir nuotraukos - mano.</i></div><p></p></div></div></div>","capture":"20210411094437","source":"http://www.ortodoksas.lt/2021/03/veganiskas-bulviu-plokstainis.html"}
